ater with an ominous large fish shadow in it.\"/>\n<figcaption>\n<p data-aid=\"166810267\" id=\"figure5_figure1_p1\"><cite>Jona en de walvis</cite>, Kevin Carden</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<a class=\"enlarge\" href=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/45/uw/45uwdorbqcg7ep3x2o9d9xmbsst6irjqei9z90db/come_follow_me_2026.pdf\">\n<img alt=\"doe-pagina voor het jeugdwerk: De Heer zal me helpen om Hem te gehoorzamen, zelfs als dat moeilijk is\" data-scale=\"800\" id=\"figure5_img2\" src=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%21320%2C/0/default\" data-assetId=\"9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot\" srcset=\"https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%2160%2C/0/default 60w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%21100%2C/0/default 100w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%21200%2C/0/default 200w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%21250%2C/0/default 250w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%21320%2C/0/default 320w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%21500%2C/0/default 500w,https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/imgs/9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot/full/%21640%2C/0/default 640w\" data-img-id=\"9dmiag8u64xjrp0xh12t60mniu7fa9657bjdszot\" data-missing-asset=\"false\" data-width=\"320\" data-height=\"415\" data-aspect-ratio=\"0.7710843373493976\"/>\n</a><a href=\"https://assets.churchofjesuschrist.org/45/uw/45uwdorbqcg7ep3x2o9d9xmbsst6irjqei9z90db/come_follow_me_2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-icon=\"pdf\" class=\"open-pdf\">PDF openen</a>\n</figure>\n</div>"
